2:T474,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BlogPosting","@id":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/betfred-football-commentator#blogposting","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/betfred-football-commentator","headline":"Betfred Football Commentator","url":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/betfred-football-commentator","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Guy Harris","url":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/voiceoverguy","image":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/assets/images/guy-harris-profile.jpg"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"VoiceoverGuy","url":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/assets/images/guy-harris-voiceover.png"}},"inLanguage":"en-GB","isAccessibleForFree":true,"description":"Betfred Football Commentator - A fun viral video for Betfred. The UK-based bookmaker. As the main voice over and the character it was a fun project to voice","datePublished":"2016-07-01T00:00:00+00:00","dateModified":"2016-07-01T00:00:00+00:00","image":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/assets/img/blog/betfred-football-commentator.jpg"}}3:T48d,<h2>Betfred Football Commentator Voice</h2>
<p>Whenever a big football moment comes around, I always seem to get the call to bring my football commentator voice to life. It still makes me laugh, as I don’t actually watch any football… yet I end up voicing campaigns for brands like <a href="/manchester-city-football-commentry-voice" title="Manchester City Football Voice">Manchester City</a>, <a href="/etisalat-celebrating-victory-football-commentator-voice" title="Etisalat Football Commentator">Etisalat</a>, <a href="/just-eat-uefa-football-commentator-voice" title="Just Eat UEFA Voice">Just Eat</a> and <a href="/turkish-airlines-football-commentator-voiceover" title="Turkish Airlines Voice">Turkish Airlines</a>.</p>

<p>This Betfred campaign was a fun one. Fast-paced, character-driven and full of energy, the sort of tone clients ask for when they want a big, lively commentator read. My commercial work ranges from <a href="/explainer-video-voice" title="Explainer Voiceovers">explainer videos</a> through to <a href="/commercial-voiceover" title="Commercial Voiceovers">commercial campaigns</a>, so adapting the style is all part of the job.</p>4:T445,<h2>Get in Touch</h2>
<p>If you need a football commentator voice for your promo, online campaign, stadium content or comedy sketch, I can help. Just let me know the intended usage so I can quote accurately. If you’re still pitching the idea, I’m happy to send over a short custom sample from your script.</p>

<p>You can also explore other character styles I perform, such as my <a href="/apple-voice-style" title="Apple Style Voice">Apple-style voice</a>, my <a href="/david-attenborough-voice" title="Attenborough Voice">David Attenborough narration</a> or my <a href="/santa-voice" title="Santa Voice">Santa voice</a>. Whatever your project, I’ll aim to record on the same day.</p>

<div style="margin:20px 0;">
    <audio controls style="width:100%; max-width:420px;">
        <source src="/assets/audio/football-commentator-showreel-guy-harris.mp3" type="audio/mpeg">
        Your browser does not support the audio element.
    </audio>
    <p style="font-size:0.9em; opacity:0.8; margin-top:5px;">
        Football Commentator Showreel – Guy Harris
    </p>
</div>8:["slug","betfred-football-commentator","d"]
